{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This Wireframe theme is a theme for some specific usages, like for prototyping and design of journeys with non-Orange charted themes."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","code":["🧬 Theme version: 2.5.0"],"syntax":null},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Wireframe theme uses the Shantell Sans font family","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Wireframe theme does not embed charts colors yet, and is read only: it cannot be suclassed or derivated.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important","style":"important"},{"type":"heading","text":"How to use the theme","anchor":"How-to-use-the-theme","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/WireframeTheme","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" directly. To use the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/WireframeTheme","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" without further modifications, you will have to use the "},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for your root view and give it an instance of "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/WireframeTheme","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". Keep in mind the themes are "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift class objects","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and can be heavy, so you may use only as instance as singleton and not store any properties."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            OUDSThemeableView(theme: WireframeTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then, in your views, you can simply use the theme through an environment variable to get the tokens:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct SomeView: View {","","    \/\/ Get OUDS environment variable for theme thanks to themeable view","    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme","    ","    var body: some View {","        ","        \/\/ Use the theme to retrieve the tokens","        \/\/ For spaces: theme.spaces","        \/\/ For sizes: theme.sizes","        \/\/ For borders: theme.borders","        \/\/ For elevations: theme.elevations","        \/\/ For opacities: theme.opacities","        \/\/ For colors: theme.colors","        \/\/ For button configuration: theme.button","        \/\/ For link configuration: theme.link","        \/\/ Etc.","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"How to tune the theme","anchor":"How-to-tune-the-theme","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You cannot tune the Wireframe theme."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Typography","anchor":"Typography","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Wireframe theme uses the Shantell Sans font family and must not use others."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How to enrich the theme","anchor":"How-to-enrich-the-theme","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You cannot derivate the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Wireframe","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" theme."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How it looks like","anchor":"How-it-looks-like","level":2},{"type":"heading","text":"Actions","anchor":"Actions","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_button_Wireframe.png","type":"image"}]},{"type":"heading"